# example: foos
! error: 0 is wrong flag id
! error: 0 is wrong flag id
! error: 0 is wrong flag id
! error: flag id 70000 is out of range
! error: flag id 70002 is out of range
! error: flag id 70002 is out of range
! error: line 2: 0 is wrong flag id
! error: line 2: flag id 70000 is out of range
! error: line 3: 0 is wrong flag id
